The lab will meet for lunch at Thai Gardens on Main Street to catch up with each others’ projects, brainstorm, and try to engage in some off-the-cuff problem solving. Bring ideas and issues from your projects, and suggestions workshops that would help us all further our research agendas, or work to make the intersect even more.
